<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Moulin shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Moulin shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of opitcal products maker Moulin International Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Moulin shares ended HK$0.05 up at HK$5.55 each on Wednesday on volume of 786,375 shares worth HK$4.34 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
